cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this calculator, please cite it as below.
title: Robotic DIEP Selection Calculator
abstract: >-
  Browser-only research and educational calculator implementing a proposed
  framework for selecting patients for robotic-assisted DIEP flap harvest using
  preoperative CT angiography. Not a medical device; suggestions are unvalidated.
type: software
